error[SC0417]: a function value selected at run time cannot be returned from the function that selects it
  --> /main/main.sol:18:9
   |
17 |     if (c) {
18 |         return inc;
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^ function value selected at run time used here
19 |     }
   |
   = note: function values have no run-time representation: a value chosen by run-time control flow is compiled to a selector over a finite set of closures known at compile time
   = note: the selector and the captured values exist only in the function that makes the choice: there the selected value can be called or passed to other functions, but it cannot be returned, alone or inside another value
   = note: help: call the function value where it is selected, or select it in the caller
